{
 "uid": "ravena-llm",
 "title": "Ravena — Uso de LLM",
 "tags": [
  "ravena",
  "otel",
  "llm"
 ],
 "timezone": "browser",
 "schemaVersion": 39,
 "version": 1,
 "refresh": "5m",
 "time": {
  "from": "now-7d",
  "to": "now"
 },
 "description": "Uso de LLM da ravena-ai (LLMService): requisições, falhas, latência e uso por modelo/provedor, a partir das métricas derivadas dos spans pelo OpenTelemetry Collector (span_metrics → Prometheus). Ver OBSERVABILITY.md.",
 "links": [
  {
   "title": "RED e gargalos",
   "url": "/d/ravena-red",
   "type": "link",
   "icon": "dashboard",
   "keepTime": true
  },
  {
   "title": "Traces de LLM no Jaeger",
   "url": "http://localhost:16686/search?service=ravena-ai&operation=llm.request",
   "type": "link",
   "targetBlank": true,
   "icon": "external link"
  }
 ],
 "templating": {
  "list": [
   {
    "name": "modelo",
    "label": "Modelo",
    "type": "query",
    "datasource": {
     "type": "prometheus",
     "uid": "prometheus"
    },
    "query": {
     "query": "label_values(traces_span_metrics_calls_total{service_name=\"ravena-ai\",span_name=~\"chat .*\"}, gen_ai_request_model)",
     "refId": "A"
    },
    "definition": "label_values(traces_span_metrics_calls_total{service_name=\"ravena-ai\",span_name=~\"chat .*\"}, gen_ai_request_model)",
    "includeAll": true,
    "multi": true,
    "allValue": ".*",
    "current": {
     "text": "All",
     "value": "$__all"
    },
    "refresh": 2,
    "sort": 1
   }
  ]
 },
 "panels": [
  {
   "id": 1,
   "type": "text",
   "title": "",
   "description": "",
   "datasource": null,
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 0,
    "y": 0,
    "w": 24,
    "h": 2
   },
   "targets": [],
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {},
    "overrides": []
   },
   "options": {
    "mode": "markdown",
    "content": "**Quanto a ravena usa de LLM e como está respondendo?** Requisições, falhas, latência e uso por modelo e provedor, das métricas que o OpenTelemetry Collector deriva dos spans (`llm.request` e `chat <modelo>`). Tokens e tempo de fila ficam só nos traces (Jaeger), não viram métrica."
   },
   "transparent": true
  },
  {
   "id": 2,
   "type": "stat",
   "title": "Requisições de LLM (período)",
   "description": "Pedidos à LLMService.getCompletion (span llm.request: fila, tentativas e fallback juntos) no período do seletor.",
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "prometheus"
   },
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 0,
    "y": 2,
    "w": 5,
    "h": 4
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "refId": "A",
     "datasource": {
      "type": "prometheus",
      "uid": "prometheus"
     },
     "expr": "round(sum(increase(traces_span_metrics_calls_total{service_name=\"ravena-ai\",span_name=\"llm.request\"}[$__range])))",
     "legendFormat": "requisições",
     "range": false,
     "instant": true
    }
   ],
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "unit": "locale",
     "decimals": 0,
     "noValue": "0",
     "color": {
      "mode": "fixed",
      "fixedColor": "text"
     }
    },
    "overrides": []
   },
   "options": {
    "reduceOptions": {
     "calcs": [
      "lastNotNull"
     ],
     "fields": "",
     "values": false
    },
    "colorMode": "none",
    "graphMode": "none",
    "textMode": "value",
    "justifyMode": "center",
    "wideLayout": true,
    "showPercentChange": false
   }
  },
  {
   "id": 3,
   "type": "stat",
   "title": "Falhas (período)",
   "description": "Requisições que terminaram com erro (status ERROR no span llm.request), depois de tentativas e fallback. Âmbar a partir de 1.",
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "prometheus"
   },
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 5,
    "y": 2,
    "w": 5,
    "h": 4
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "refId": "A",
     "datasource": {
      "type": "prometheus",
      "uid": "prometheus"
     },
     "expr": "round(sum(increase(traces_span_metrics_calls_total{service_name=\"ravena-ai\",span_name=\"llm.request\",status_code=\"STATUS_CODE_ERROR\"}[$__range])) or vector(0))",
     "legendFormat": "falhas",
     "range": false,
     "instant": true
    }
   ],
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "unit": "locale",
     "decimals": 0,
     "noValue": "0",
     "color": {
      "mode": "thresholds"
     },
     "thresholds": {
      "mode": "absolute",
      "steps": [
       {
        "color": "text",
        "value": null
       },
       {
        "color": "#e5a650",
        "value": 1
       }
      ]
     }
    },
    "overrides": []
   },
   "options": {
    "reduceOptions": {
     "calcs": [
      "lastNotNull"
     ],
     "fields": "",
     "values": false
    },
    "colorMode": "value",
    "graphMode": "none",
    "textMode": "value",
    "justifyMode": "center",
    "wideLayout": true,
    "showPercentChange": false
   }
  },
  {
   "id": 4,
   "type": "stat",
   "title": "Falhas (% das requisições)",
   "description": "Falhas ÷ requisições no período. Âmbar a partir de 5% (limite provisório).",
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "prometheus"
   },
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 10,
    "y": 2,
    "w": 5,
    "h": 4
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "refId": "A",
     "datasource": {
      "type": "prometheus",
      "uid": "prometheus"
     },
     "expr": "100 * (sum(increase(traces_span_metrics_calls_total{service_name=\"ravena-ai\",span_name=\"llm.request\",status_code=\"STATUS_CODE_ERROR\"}[$__range])) or vector(0)) / sum(increase(traces_span_metrics_calls_total{service_name=\"ravena-ai\",span_name=\"llm.request\"}[$__range]))",
     "legendFormat": "%",
     "range": false,
     "instant": true
    }
   ],
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "unit": "percent",
     "decimals": 1,
     "noValue": "—",
     "color": {
      "mode": "thresholds"
     },
     "thresholds": {
      "mode": "absolute",
      "steps": [
       {
        "color": "text",
        "value": null
       },
       {
        "color": "#e5a650",
        "value": 5
       }
      ]
     }
    },
    "overrides": []
   },
   "options": {
    "reduceOptions": {
     "calcs": [
      "lastNotNull"
     ],
     "fields": "",
     "values": false
    },
    "colorMode": "value",
    "graphMode": "none",
    "textMode": "value",
    "justifyMode": "center",
    "wideLayout": true,
    "showPercentChange": false
   }
  },
  {
   "id": 5,
   "type": "stat",
   "title": "p95 da requisição (período)",
   "description": "95% das requisições terminaram em até este tempo, contando fila, tentativas e fallback (llm.request). Buckets do collector: o valor é interpolado entre 1 s, 2,5 s, 5 s, 10 s, 30 s e 60 s.",
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "prometheus"
   },
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 15,
    "y": 2,
    "w": 5,
    "h": 4
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "refId": "A",
     "datasource": {
      "type": "prometheus",
      "uid": "prometheus"
     },
     "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (increase(traces_span_metrics_duration_milliseconds_bucket{service_name=\"ravena-ai\",span_name=\"llm.request\"}[$__range])))",
     "legendFormat": "p95",
     "range": false,
     "instant": true
    }
   ],
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "unit": "ms",
     "noValue": "—",
     "color": {
      "mode": "fixed",
      "fixedColor": "text"
     }
    },
    "overrides": []
   },
   "options": {
    "reduceOptions": {
     "calcs": [
      "lastNotNull"
     ],
     "fields": "",
     "values": false
    },
    "colorMode": "none",
    "graphMode": "none",
    "textMode": "value",
    "justifyMode": "center",
    "wideLayout": true,
    "showPercentChange": false
   }
  },
  {
   "id": 6,
   "type": "stat",
   "title": "Chamadas ao provedor",
   "description": "Chamadas HTTP a provedores (spans chat <modelo>): uma requisição pode gerar várias (rodadas de tool, fallback para outro modelo).",
